msgstr "Schema.org Article"

msgid "Adds Schema.org/Article to the JSON LD array. Creates Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle or APIReference."
msgstr "Añade Schema.org/Article a la matriz JSON LD. Crea Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle o APIReference."

